          "content": "Essay: Generosity (Based on Mind Map)\n\nGenerosity is the supreme moral quality of giving freely of one's wealth, time, compassion, and energy without expecting anything in return. Being generous means feeling genuine sympathy toward less fortunate people and actively striving to make their lives easier and more pleasant.\n\nTrue generosity is not restricted to affluent individuals donating vast sums of money; it is equally reflected in a warm smile, an encouraging word, and saving our own resources so that we may share with those in distress. When we practice generosity, we conquer selfishness and cultivate contentment. As demonstrated by the life of Hazrat Usman Ghani (رضی اللہ عنہ), wealth spent in the service of humanity is never lost—it earns eternal spiritual rewards and secures peace and dignity for the entire community."
